    "type": "game",
    "name": "My Wasteland Diary",
    "steam_appid": 3263410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/250878dc19b4fd978ce01abd0e406090.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is A Post-apocalyptic, High-Freedom, Sandbox Survival Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future wasteland, resources are scarce, and danger lurks at every corner. You play as a survivor, scavenging, crafting, and exploring the open world in search of ways to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/0bec428811e887ab67e94725f44caa47.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span>Along the way, you will encounter NPCs who are also struggling to survive in this harsh environment. You can choose to cooperate or confront them, help the weak or plunder others... Every decision you make will shape your unique journey through the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/315bf8afe7933043f4ddd4a7f9afbaa4.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic NPC World</strong> <br>The game features randomly generated NPCs who make decisions based on their needs and past experiences, such as cooperation, trade, revenge, or plunder. Each NPC can become either your ally or your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/d74a592800212b302d075b3db4c00cde.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/a4d545ccfe0172c5609b3cab5dde3e17.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/a9f231fc41d0ae68206e704a38675ce1.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Freedom Gameplay</strong><br>On a seamlessly connected open-world map, you\u2019ll freely explore resource nodes, trade, and craft equipment. You can found your own faction and become its leader, or join an NPC faction to serve the powerful\u2014using your cunning and strength to enforce your own laws in this post-apocalyptic world..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/f306ca538a82eaf697be7b256e3bea45.poster.avif?t=1754558360\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/f306ca538a82eaf697be7b256e3bea45.webm?t=1754558360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/f306ca538a82eaf697be7b256e3bea45.mp4?t=1754558360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/83a09a6bfc9192d3e4313f15e231f009.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Combat System</strong><br>The real-time combat system requires you to strategically equip yourself and your NPC companions with the right weapons and gear to overcome various enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/0d5c4dae7a20eb0460d31cddf733539e.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/8376ebaea06520aa68cf140730534d0e.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading and Economic System</strong><br>In addition to raiding enemy resource points for supplies, you'll need to understand market shifts caused by supply and demand to find the best strategies for survival in the resource-scarce wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/89abb0c9deafdd4936a7642a25573de1.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/4d3fd2f3cf798bd95a0af47f0634f0db.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Crafting</strong><br>By exploring and trading materials, you can craft advanced equipment to ensure the survival of yourself and your companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/7a051267af763d4b123f56141b921290.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/250878dc19b4fd978ce01abd0e406090.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is A Post-apocalyptic, High-Freedom, Sandbox Survival Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future wasteland, resources are scarce, and danger lurks at every corner. You play as a survivor, scavenging, crafting, and exploring the open world in search of ways to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/0bec428811e887ab67e94725f44caa47.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span>Along the way, you will encounter NPCs who are also struggling to survive in this harsh environment. You can choose to cooperate or confront them, help the weak or plunder others... Every decision you make will shape your unique journey through the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/315bf8afe7933043f4ddd4a7f9afbaa4.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic NPC World</strong> <br>The game features randomly generated NPCs who make decisions based on their needs and past experiences, such as cooperation, trade, revenge, or plunder. Each NPC can become either your ally or your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/d74a592800212b302d075b3db4c00cde.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/a4d545ccfe0172c5609b3cab5dde3e17.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/a9f231fc41d0ae68206e704a38675ce1.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Freedom Gameplay</strong><br>On a seamlessly connected open-world map, you\u2019ll freely explore resource nodes, trade, and craft equipment. You can found your own faction and become its leader, or join an NPC faction to serve the powerful\u2014using your cunning and strength to enforce your own laws in this post-apocalyptic world..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/f306ca538a82eaf697be7b256e3bea45.poster.avif?t=1754558360\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/f306ca538a82eaf697be7b256e3bea45.webm?t=1754558360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/f306ca538a82eaf697be7b256e3bea45.mp4?t=1754558360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/83a09a6bfc9192d3e4313f15e231f009.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Combat System</strong><br>The real-time combat system requires you to strategically equip yourself and your NPC companions with the right weapons and gear to overcome various enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/0d5c4dae7a20eb0460d31cddf733539e.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/8376ebaea06520aa68cf140730534d0e.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading and Economic System</strong><br>In addition to raiding enemy resource points for supplies, you'll need to understand market shifts caused by supply and demand to find the best strategies for survival in the resource-scarce wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/89abb0c9deafdd4936a7642a25573de1.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/4d3fd2f3cf798bd95a0af47f0634f0db.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Crafting</strong><br>By exploring and trading materials, you can craft advanced equipment to ensure the survival of yourself and your companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/7a051267af763d4b123f56141b921290.avif?t=1754558360\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p></li></ul>",
